# Ownership rules for the beatrax repository.
#
# Paths listed here require explicit review from the listed owner before
# any pull request that touches them can be merged. The targeted patterns
# below are deliberately narrow so that day-to-day pull requests do not
# all require an extra approval — only the release pipeline, the
# ownership file itself, and the NativePHP prebuild hooks gate on the
# owner because each of those paths can ship code or alter the build
# artifact that users download.

/.github/workflows/                 @lessevv
/.github/CODEOWNERS                 @lessevv
/scripts/nativephp_*.php            @lessevv
